WEBVTT

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:31.236
Kas ma tohiksin teile oma 
rambipalaviku laulu laulda?

00:04:31.396 --> 00:04:35.272
(Publik plaksutab)

00:04:40.743 --> 00:04:41.854
Kas ma saaksin lonksukese vett?

00:04:43.715 --> 00:04:47.886
(Muusika)

00:04:48.143 --> 00:04:49.151
Aitäh.

00:04:55.442 --> 00:04:57.891
♫ Kas tead, ma ei tee nalja, ♫

00:04:58.503 --> 00:05:00.572
♫ see rambipalavik on tõeline. ♫